WEBVTT

00:10:29.445 --> 00:10:31.095
in cases of depression.

00:10:31.095 --> 00:10:35.640
Can we use deep brain stimulation to make you smarter?

00:10:35.640 --> 00:10:37.736
(Laughter)

00:10:37.736 --> 00:10:40.302
Anybody interested in that?

00:10:40.302 --> 00:10:42.602
(Applause)

00:10:42.602 --> 00:10:45.590
Of course we can, right?

00:10:45.590 --> 00:10:47.804
So what we've decided to do is

00:10:47.804 --> 00:10:50.225
we're going to try to turbocharge

00:10:50.225 --> 00:10:52.430
the memory circuits in the brain.

00:10:52.430 --> 00:10:55.166
We're going to place electrodes within the circuits

00:10:55.166 --> 00:10:57.842
that regulate your memory and cognitive function

00:10:57.842 --> 00:11:01.112
to see if we can turn up their activity.